{
  "_doc": [
    "Animation templates for part rigs (spritewright.anim.apply_template / CLI anim-apply).",
    "Each template: description, frames (default count), fps, loop, and 'tracks' (or 'tables': {frame count: tracks}).",
    "tracks = {role: {property: spec}}. Roles are matched to rig parts via _roles aliases; missing roles are skipped.",
    "Special roles: 'root' (dx/dy added to every part), '*' (visible/swap/flip applied to every part).",
    "Properties: dx, dy (pixels, y down), flip_h, flip_v, visible, swap (alt name, 'a|b' = first existing alt, null = none).",
    "Specs: a per-frame list (resampled when the frame count differs), {'wave': {amp, period ('N', 'N/2' or number), phase, mode sine|abs|pos}},",
    "or {'keys': [[t 0..1, value, easing-of-segment?], ...], 'ease': default}. dx/dy values are multiplied by --scale, rounded half away from zero.",
    "_hierarchy: child role -> parent role; a child also moves by its parent's offsets (head/arms ride the body).",
    "Optional 'views': {view name: {description, tables|tracks}} replaces the tracks for that view (e.g. walk --view front for front-facing characters, where forward/back dx would only spread the legs)."
  ],
  "_roles": {
    "head": [
      "head"
    ],
    "body": [
      "body",
      "torso",
      "chest"
    ],
    "arm_l": [
      "arm_l",
      "arm_left",
      "left_arm",
      "hand_l"
    ],
    "arm_r": [
      "arm_r",
      "arm_right",
      "right_arm",
      "hand_r"
    ],
    "leg_l": [
      "leg_l",
      "leg_left",
      "left_leg",
      "foot_l"
    ],
    "leg_r": [
      "leg_r",
      "leg_right",
      "right_leg",
      "foot_r"
    ],
    "legs": [
      "legs",
      "feet"
    ],
    "weapon": [
      "weapon",
      "accessory",
      "sword",
      "staff",
      "item",
      "tool"
    ]
  },
  "_hierarchy": {
    "head": "body",
    "arm_l": "body",
    "arm_r": "body",
    "weapon": "arm_r"
  },
